erving more than 33,400 patients daily. PACS business support division, PACS Services, provides technology and administrative support services — accounting, finance, human resources, compliance, payroll, AR/AP, legal, risk management, information technology, corporate communication, and other business advice and support — to their healthcare facilities, reducing administrative burdens so their leadership and care teams can focus on the care, well-being, and quality of life of their patients and residents. PACS has been recognized by Utah Business magazine as one of Utah’s Best Companies to work for, back-to-back, in 2022 and 2023. They’ve also been recognized as one of Utah’s Fastest Growing Companies; they ranked #25 in 2022, and #9 in 2023. For more information, visit www.pacs.com or ir.pacs.com."]},{"type":"p","children":["View source version on businesswire.com: https://www.businesswire.com/news/home/20260930163647/en/"]}]},"language":"en","tags":[{"title":"BusinessWire","args":[{"id":"provider","value":"business_wire"}]},{"title":"US stocks","args":[{"id":"category","value":"stock"},{"id":"market_country","value":"US"}]}],"robots":["noindex"],"copyright":"2026 Business Wire, Inc., All rights reserved.","id":"business_wire:2824b9161e3a6:0","title":"Seventeen PACS Post-Acute Locations Named Top Nursing Homes for 2027 by Newsweek Magazine","published":1790806080,"urgency":2,"relatedSymbols":[{"symbol":"NYSE:PACS","logoid":"pacs","logo":{"style":"single","logoid":"pacs"}}],"storyPath":"/news/business_wire:2824b9161e3a6:0-seventeen-pacs-post-acute-locations-named-top-nursing-homes-for-2027-by-newsweek-magazine/","read_time":117,"provider":{"id":"business_wire","name":"BusinessWire","logo_id":"business-wire"}}